15087	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	MR. SURAPONG DROVE BACK FROM VISITING PRACHUB DEALER AND MR. ANUSON BOONPRASONG, KAEST WANGMUANG FROM MANAGER, AT MUAKLEK DISTRICT. HE FINISHED HIS WORK AFTER SUNSET AROUND 7:00PM AND DROVE BACK TO HIS BASE IN LOPBURI PROVINCE. IT LIGHTLY RAINED DURING DROVE BACK. HE DROVE UNDER THE SPEED AROUND 90 KM/HR. THE ROAD CONDITION IS ASPHALT AND 2 LANES. DURING THAT TIME IT HAD NO CAR ON THE ROAD EXCEPT HIS CAR ONLY. HIS CAR (TOYOTA 4 WHEEL DRIVE) UNFORTUNATELY SLIPPED AND SWAYED FROM THE ROAD TO LEFT SIDE OF THE ROAD. HE GOT EXCITED AND PANICKY. HE SUDDENLY PULLED THE WHEEL BACK AND STEPPED ON THE BREAK PADDLE IN ORDER TO CONTROL THE CAR BACK ON THE ROAD AGAIN. BUT THE CAR MOVED BACK ON THE ROAD JUST A FEW SECOND AND MOVED ACROSS THE ROAD TO THE RIGHT SIDE OF THE ROAD. THIS ACTION APPENDED VERY FAST. AT MOMENT, HE COULD NOT CONTROL HIS CAR. ON THE RIGHT SIDE OF THE ROAD, IT HAD ALUMINUM ELETRIC POLE. THEN, HIS CAR MOVED TO HIST THE ELETRIC POLE. THE LEFT FRONT WHEEL HIT THE ELETRIC POLE BASE AND THE CAR HIT THE ELETRIC POLE AND THE POLE FELL DOWN. FINALLY, THE CAR STOPPED. 	datatype.collisionclasification.fixedobject	datatype.accidentclasification.other	\N	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.forward	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.accidentfactors.others	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	t	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.rain	datatype.lighting.darknes	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.inreparation	0	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
