15009	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	AS I WAS TRAVERSING THE ABOVE-MENTIONED ROAD GOING TO WORK (TRAVELING AT AROUND 50KPH, AN INSANE LADY SUDDENLY RAN ACROSS THE ROAD (ONLY ABOUT 5 METERS AWAY FROM ME!) AND REMAINED IN THE MIDDLE FOR A COUPLE OF SECONDS. SHE WAS ALREADY VERY CLOSE, SO EVEN IF I STEPPED ON THE BREAK, I´D PROBABLY STILL HIT HER. SO THE BEST OPTION I THOUGHT (SPLIT SECOND DECISION) WAS TO TURN RIGHT SHARPLY, AWAY FROM HER, AND THEN FULL STOP. I WAS SUCCESSSFUL IN EVADING HER, BUT IN THE PROCESS I ENDED UP SLIGHTLY BUMPING THE BASE OF THE LIGHT POST ALONG THE ROADSIDE. THE DAMAGE INCURRED ON THE CAR WAS MINIMAL, THOUGH STILL PROMINENT (SCRATCH AND DENT AT THE RIGHT SIDE, ABOVE FRONT WHEEL). NOBODY WAS HURT.	datatype.collisionclasification.fixedobject	datatype.accidentclasification.other	\N	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.right	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.accidentfactors.others	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	t	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.goodweather	datatype.lighting.daylight	datatype.way.curve	datatype.circulationdirection.twowaywithout	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.dry	0	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
