14108	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	ON NOVEMBER 2,2005 AT ABOUT 9:30A.M, I WAS ON MY WAY BACK FROM A BANK TRANSACTION AND WAS ALREADY TRYING TO PARK THE VEHICLE. AT THIS POINT IN TIME, THERE WAS ONLY A SINGLE PARKING SPACE AVAILABLE BUT IT WAS SOMEWHAT IN A NARROW SITUATION SINCE THERE WAS A VEHICLE (AUV) THAT WAS PARKED IN FRONT . THIS AUV VEHICLE WAS PARKED IN A UNDERSIGNATED PARKING SAPCE. I TRIED TO PARK ON A BACKING MOTION BECAUSE THIS WAY THE BEST TO PARK GIVEN THE SITUATION. AS I TRIED TO MANOUEVRE THE CAR IN A FORWARD MOTION TO ADJUST THE WHEELS, I MISCALCULATED THE DISTANCE AND SLIGHTLY HIT THE CAR PARKED IN FRONT.	datatype.collisionclasification.fixedobject	datatype.accidentclasification.other	\N	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.forward	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.accidentfactors.others	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.lighting.daylight	datatype.way.other	datatype.circulationdirection.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.inreparation	0	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
