15986	datatype.zone.urban	t	f	f	ON 4 JUNE 2006, WHILE MR. WITTAWAT PENGCHAN DROVE HIS PICK UP TO MONSANTO BASE IN PAKCHONG AREA. IT RAINED AT THAT MOMENT. HE STOPPED HIS PICK UP IN FRONT OF THE BASE AND TRIED TO MOVE HIS PICK UP BACK TO THE PACKING AREA. BECAUSE OF RAIN AND DARK DURING THE NIGHT, HE COULD NOT SEE THE CLEAR VIEW FROM HIS MIRROR WHILE HE MOVED HIS PICK UP BACK. THE MIRROR WAS UNCLEAR DURING THE RAIN. HE SUDDENLY MOVED THE PICK UP BACK AND HE COULD NOT SEE THE CLEAR PICTURE. THEN HIS RIGHT SIDE OF HIS PICK UP JOSTLED WITH THE MAIN GATE. 	datatype.collisionclasification.betweenmotionvehicles	datatype.accidentclasification.ourdriverparkingbacking	\N	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.backing	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.accidentfactors.others	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	t	t	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.rain	datatype.lighting.darknes	datatype.way.other	datatype.circulationdirection.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.humid	250	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
