14468	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	THE VEHICLE WAS IN A "STAND STILL TRAFFIC DUE TO AN INTERSECTION AHEAD (PIONEER ST. AND UNITED ST.).THE VEHICLE I WAS DRIVING WAS SUDDENLY HIT AT THE REAR BY A TRICYCLE CAUSING MINOR SURFACE PAINT DAMAGE ON THE SPARE TIRE COVER AND LOWER LEFT SIDE OF THE REAR BUMBER. THE SAID INCIDENT WAS REPORTED TO THE BAGONG ILOG POLICE STATION, PASIG CITY. NO ONE WAS INJURED IN THE INCIDENT.	datatype.collisionclasification.incident	\N	datatype.incidentclasification.almostaccident	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.stuck	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.lighting.darknes	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.oneway	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.inreparation	0	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
