14259	datatype.zone.unpopulatedrural	t	f	f	VIAGEM DE SHG A UDI- AO MANOBRAR O SITE CAR FIESTA EM 2a.MARCHA A VELOCIDADE INFERIOR A 10 KM/H NO OBJETIVO DE DESVIAR DE GRANDES BURACOS NAS BR 452 (5 KM DE BOM JESUS - GO), FUI OBRIGADO A UTILIZAR O ACOSTAMENTO DE TERRA COMO DESVIO. EM VIRTUDE DO DESNÍVEL ENTRE O ACOSTAMENTO (COBERTO COM ÁGUA PLUVIAL) E O ASFALTO, A PARTE INFERIOR DO PARA-CHOQUE DIANTEIRO CHOCOU-SE COM O PAVIMENTO, PROVOCANDO PEQUENA TRINCA. NÃO HOUVE DANOS AO MOTOR E SUSPENSÃO. CHOVIA FORTE NO MOMENTO.\n	datatype.collisionclasification.incident	\N	datatype.incidentclasification.animalcontact	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.lane	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	t	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.rain	datatype.lighting.daylight	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.twowaywith	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.humid	50	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
13731	datatype.zone.urban	t	f	t	A MONSANTO DRIVER, MR. THANOMPONG WAS TRAVELING IN THE LEFT HAND LANE OF A 4 LANE HIGHWAY WITH A SPEED LIMIT OF 90 KM/H. VISIBILITY WAS POOR DUE TO BAD WEATHER AND IT WAS STARTING TO GET DARK. THANOMPONG WAS TRAVELING UNDER THE SPEED LIMIT AT APPROX 60 KM/H. HE DECREASED HIS SPEED FURTHER TO APPROXIMATELY 40 KM/H BY TAKING HIS FOOT OFF THE ACELERATOR AS HE WAS PASSING HIS HOUSE. OUT OF NOWHERE A MOTORBIKE RAN INTO THE BACK OF THE MONSANTO VEHICLE. THE POLICE INVESTIGATION CONFIRMED THAT THE MOTORCYCLE DRIVER WAS DRUNK AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT AND WAS TRAVELING AT A VERY HIGH SPEED WITHOUT HEADLIGHTS ON. THESE POINTS COULD CONTRIBUTE TO THE REASON THANOMPONG HAD NOT SEEN THE MOTORBIKE PRIOR TO THE COLLISION. THE DRIVER OF THE MOTORBIKE DIED ON IMPACT. THE MONSANTO DRIVER WAS NOT INJURED AND THE DAMAGE TO THE MONSANTO CAR WAS RESTRICTED TO THE REAR.	datatype.collisionclasification.incident	\N	datatype.incidentclasification.almostaccident	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.forward	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	1	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.rain	datatype.lighting.darknes	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.oneway	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.humid	1250	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
