16141	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	TRAFEGANDO PELA PISTA DIREITA (INTERNA) ESTAVA SENDO ULTRAPASSADO POR UM VEICULO MARCA HYUNDAI (COROLLA) QUANDO 2 CACHORROS (RAÇA BOXER) ENTRARAM NA PISTA. UM DELES FOI ATROPELADO PELO COROLLA E FOI JOGADO DE VOLTA AO CANTEIRO CENTRAL (MACHUCADO NA PATA) ENQUANTO O OUTRO QUE VINHA A FRENTE TENTOU ESCAPAR CRUZANDO A PISTA. FOI AÍ QUE ACABEI ATROPELANDO-O, DANIFICANDO A CAPA DO PARA-CHOQUE (É DE PLASTICO), O FAROL NEBLINA, A PLACA, E QUEBRANDO O SUPORTE DO FAROL. O CACHORRO MORREU POIS SUPOSTAMENTE BATEU COM A CABEÇA NO PARA-CHOQUE (PARTE MAIS FIRME) E NO FAROL NEBLINA. NENHUM FERIMENTO, NENHUM PREJUIZO PARA O DESLOCAMENTO DO VEICULO, POIS O FAROL FUNCIONA NORMALMENTE E NENHUMA PARTE MECANICA FOI AFETADA.	datatype.collisionclasification.incident	\N	datatype.incidentclasification.pavementfalis	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.forward	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.goodweather	datatype.lighting.darknes	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.twowaywithout	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.inreparation	0	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
13890	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	AT ABOUT 10:15 AM, THE VEHICLE IS TRAVELLING NORTH BOUND ALONG MAHARLIKA HIWAY IN STA ROSA NUEVA ECIJA. AT THIS POINT, I, THE DRIVER, ERWIN G. VIBAL NOTICED THAT THE STREERING WHEEL IS STARTING TO WIGGLE. I IMMEDIATELY REDUCED MY SPEED AND APPLIED THE BRAKES. THE VEHICLE HAS NOT YET COME TO A FULL STOP WHEN SUDDENLY THE STEERING WHEEL STARTED TO LEAN TOWARDS THE RIGHT SIDE TAKING THE VEHICLE OFF-THE-ROAD. I APPLIED FULL BRAKES UNTIL THE VEHICLE HAS STOPPED FULLY. LUCKILY, THERE WERE NO VEHICLES AND PEDESTRIANS ALONG THE SIDE OF THE ROAD. NO ONE WAS HURT/INJURED. UPON CHECKING, IT WAS LEARNED THAT THE VEHICLE HAS EXPERIENCED MECHANICAL TROUBLES. THE LOWER ARM OF THE BALL JOINT BOTH LEFT & RIGHT IS ALREADY DAMAGED INCLUDING THE TIE-ROD BOTH LEFT & RIGHT CAUSING THE VEHICLE TO WIGGLE.	datatype.collisionclasification.incident	\N	datatype.incidentclasification.mecanicalfail	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.forward	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.goodweather	datatype.lighting.daylight	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.twowaywithout	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.dry	250	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
14647	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	t	f	AT APPROXIMATELY 2 PM ON JANUARY 27, 2006, I WAS TRAVERSING ALONG THE HIGHWAY OF POBLACION, QUEZON, BUKIDNON ON MY WAY TO DAVAO CITY, AT SPEED 40-50 KPH. I WAS BLOWING MY HORN CONSTANTLY CONSIDERING THE PLACE IS A MUNICIPALITY. AT ABOUT 50 METERS AWAY,I SAW A KID IN YELLOW SHIRT STANDING AT ABOUT 2 METERS FROM THE HIGHWAY. INCIDENTALLY, I REDUCED SPEED AND BLEW MY HORN SUCCESSIVELY TO WARN THE KID. AT THE POINT WHERE I WAS IN PARALLEL WITH HIM, THE KID SUDDENLY MOVED AND RAN TO MY DIRECTION, BUT HE WAS LOOKING BACKWARD. I INSTINCTLY AND INSTANTLY SWERVED THE STEERING WHEEL AWAY FROM HIM, HOWEVER HE WAS STILL ABLE TO BUMP THE 2ND RIGHT DOOR OF THE VEHICLE AND GOT INJURED. I DID MANEUVER A U-TURN TO PICK HIM UP AND BROUGHT HIM TO A NEARBY ST. CLAIRE HOSPITAL WHERE HE IS NOW CONFINED FOR TREATMENT. AFTER THAT I CALLED MOPHIL VSL-RAMIL BONIFACIO BUT WASN´T ABLE TO GET THROUGH THEN I CALLED UP JOCEL CLAMOR FOR HER TO INFORM THE INSURANCE FOR IMMEDIATE ACTION. WHEN THE PATIENT WAS ESTABILIZED I WENT DIRECTLY TO THE POLICE STATION OF QUEZON TO RECORD THE ACCIDENT.	datatype.collisionclasification.pedestrian	datatype.accidentclasification.atrop	\N	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.overtaking	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	1	\N	\N	f	f	f	f	f	f	t	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	datatype.climate.goodweather	datatype.lighting.daylight	datatype.way.straight	datatype.circulationdirection.twowaywithout	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.dry	117	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
