13892	datatype.zone.populatedrural	t	f	f	AT AROUND 9AM ON SEPTEMBER 17, 2005 WHILE I WAS DRIVING MY VEHICLE LFD 550 WITH MY WIFE TRAVERSING THE NATIONAL HIGHWAY IN THE DIRECTION GOING TO DAVAO CITY, MY REAR END AT THE DRIVER SIDE WAS HIT BY A MOTORCYCLE. THE MOTORCYCLE WAS SUPPOSED TO BE OVERTAKING MY VEHICLE, BUT MISCALCULATED HIS DISTANCE FROM MY VEHICLE. HE WAS NOT ABLE TO APPLY BREAKS ON TIME. THE IMPACT CREATED A DAMAGE ON THE TAIL LIGHT AND REMOVED THE RUBBER SIDE OF THE BUMPER AT THE BACK. THERE WERE NO INJURIES INFLICTED ON THE MOTORCYCLE DRIVER AND TO ME.	datatype.collisionclasification.incident	\N	datatype.incidentclasification.almostaccident	datatype.vehiclebehaviour.forward	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	f	\N	datatype.driverstate.safe	0	\N	0	0	\N	\N	t	f	f	t	f	f	t	f	f	f	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.circulationdirection.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	generic.messages.nodata	datatype.conditionrout.inreparation	0	0	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
